// The upper half of the ellipsoid x²/36 + y²/16 + z²/9 ≤ 1.
//
// Refused: no two of its semi-axes are equal, so no revolve makes it, and popkern has no
// ellipsoid and no scaling of a body by different factors along its axes.
throw "popkern has no ellipsoid, and no scaling of a body by different factors along x, y and z";
